Updataed version of OOD test set for LAMBench.



| Name                      | Domain              | Labels | Frames | Description                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| ------------------------- | ------------------- | ------ | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| *Mazitov2024Surface*      | Inorganic Materials | EFV    | 422    | A down-sampled dataset of*HEA25S*, for high-entropy alloy surfaces, focusing on d-block transition metals covering 25 elements.                                                                          |
| *Lopanitsyna2023Modeling* | Inorganic Materials | EFV    | 900    | A down-sampled dataset of*HEA25*, for high-entropy alloy bulk structures, focusing on d-block transition metals covering 25 elements.                                                                    |
| *Torres2019Analysis*      | Inorganic Materials | EF     | 1000   | A dataset of Ca-bearing minerals, focusing on silicates and carbonates.                                                                                                                                  |
| *Sours2023Predicting*     | Inorganic Materials | EF     | 1000   | A down-sampled dataset consisting of 219 different pure silica zeolite topologies.                                                                                                                       |
| *Batzner2022equivariant*  | Inorganic Materials | EF     | 1000   | A down-sampled dataset containing lithium phosphate amorphous glass used by NequIP graph neural network models as evaluation configurations.                                                             |
| *Gao2025Spontaneous*      | Inorganic Materials | EFV    | 1000   | A down-sampled Bilayer 2D MoS₂ structures.                                                                                                                                                              |
| *ANI-1x*                  | Molecules           | EF     | 997    | A down-sampled dataset from the training data of the ANI-1x potential, containing organic molecule structures.                                                                                           |
| *MD22*                    | Molecules           | EF     | 1000   | A down-sampled dataset from MD22, where molecular dynamics (MD) trajectories of 42-atom tetrapeptide Ac-Ala₃-NHMe, docosahexaenoic acid, Stachyose, DNA base pair (AT-AT), DNA base pair (AT-AT-CG-CG). |
| *AIMD-Chig*               | Molecules           | EF     | 942    | A down-sampled MD dataset containing conformations of chignolin protein.                                                                                                                                 |
| *Zhang2019Bridging*       | Catalysis           | EF     | 1000   | A down-sampled dataset for interaction of carbon dioxide with a movable Ni(100) surface.                                                                                                                 |
| *Vandermause2022Active*   | Catalysis           | EFV    | 250    | A down-sampled dataset for direct simulation of hydrogen turnover on Pt(111) catalyst surfaces.                                                                                                          |
| *Villanueva2024Water*     | Catalysis           | EF     | 1000   | A down-sampled dataset for selective CO₂ hydrogenation to methanol over oxide catalysts.                                                                                                                |